<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>

<head>
    <meta charset="utf-8">
    <style>
        * {
            font-family: 'Calibri Light', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            color: #000;
        }

        .page {
            padding: 0;
        }

        .letter-body {
            font-size: 12.5px;
            line-height: 1.42;
            padding: 0 10px;
        }

        .letter-body p {
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .spaced-block {
            margin-top: 32px;
        }

        .party-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }

        .party-table td {
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .bg-details {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 12.5px;
        }

        .bg-details td {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 3px 8px;
            vertical-align: top;
        }

        .bg-details .label {
            width: 230px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .rep-table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
            margin: 8px 0;
            font-size: 11.5px;
        }

        .rep-table th,
        .rep-table td {
            border: 1px solid #333;
            padding: 3px 6px;
            text-align: left;
        }

        .rep-table th {
            background: #f2f2f2;
        }

        .signature-block {
            margin-top: 12px;
        }

        .signature-block p {
            margin: 0;
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="page">
        <div class="letter-body">
            <br><br><br>
            <table class="party-table">
                <tr>
                    <td style="text-align: left;">
                        To,<br>
                        {{#if cpName}}{{ cpName }},<br>{{/if}}
                        {{#if cpDesignation}}{{ cpDesignation }},<br>{{/if}}
                        {{#if courierAddress}}<span style="white-space: pre-line;">{{ courierAddress }}</span>{{/if}}
                    </td>
                    <td style="text-align: right; white-space: nowrap;">
                        <strong>Date:</strong> {{ date }}
                    </td>
                </tr>
            </table>
            

            {{#if referenceNo}}
            <p class="spaced-block"><strong>{{ referenceLabel }}:</strong> {{ referenceNo }}</p>
            {{/if}}

            <p class="spaced-block">
                <strong>Subject:</strong> Submission and SFMS Confirmation of Bank Guarantee{{#if referenceNo}} for
                {{ referenceLabel }} {{ referenceNo }}{{/if}}
            </p>
            <br>

            <p><strong>Dear Sir,</strong></p>

            <p>
                We are pleased to confirm the submission of the Bank Guarantee{{#if referenceNo}} against
                {{ referenceLabel }} <strong>{{ referenceNo }}</strong>{{/if}}, for the purpose of {{ purpose }}.
            </p>

            <table class="bg-details">
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Bank Guarantee No.</td>
                    <td><strong>{{ bgNo }}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Bank Guarantee Date</td>
                    <td><strong>{{ bgDate }}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Bank Guarantee Expiry</td>
                    <td><strong>{{ bgExpiryDate }}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Bank Guarantee Claim Period</td>
                    <td><strong>{{ claimDate }}</strong></td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td class="label">Bank Guarantee Amount</td>
                    <td><strong>Rs. {{ amount }}</strong></td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>
                We would like to inform you that, along with the Bank Guarantee, our bank has sent an
                SFMS (Structured Financial Messaging System) confirmation to your bank branch as per the
                IFSC shared by you. The SFMS confirmation is an electronic transmission sent between banks,
                which is a confirmation of the authenticity of the Bank Guarantee. We request that you take
                the SFMS confirmation from your bank. In the meantime, we too are arranging the SFMS copy
                from our bank and will mail the same to you in a few days.
            </p>

            <p>
                Once the SFMS confirmation is submitted, no additional bank confirmation is required for the
                BG confirmation. However, if you still require a separate confirmation letter from the bank,
                you may contact the following Bank representatives
            </p>

            <table class="rep-table">
                <tr>
                    <th>Name</th>
                    <th>Designation</th>
                    <th>Phone No.</th>
                    <th>Email Id</th>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Manish Kumar</td>
                    <td>Trade Desk Officer</td>
                    <td>+91-9057042155</td>
                    <td>manish.kumar142@aubank.in</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Pratik Rathore</td>
                    <td>Product Sales Manager Trade Finance</td>
                    <td>+91-9205172471</td>
                    <td>pratik.rathore@aubank.in</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>Sourabh Kumar</td>
                    <td>Trade Forex Head</td>
                    <td>+91-8130611897</td>
                    <td>kumar.sourabh@aubank.in</td>
                </tr>
                <tr>
                    <td>BG Confirmation Team</td>
                    <td>-</td>
                    <td>-</td>
                    <td>bgconfirm_ctu@aubank.in</td>
                </tr>
            </table>

            <p>Please contact the undersigned for any further clarification.</p>

            <p>Best Regards,</p>

            <div class="signature-block">
                <p><strong>{{ teamLeaderName }}</strong></p>
                <p>Team Leader</p>
                <p>{{ teamLeaderPhone }}</p>
                <p>{{ teamLeaderEmail }}</p>
            </div>

            <div class="signature-block">
                <p><strong>{{ accountsLeaderName }}</strong></p>
                <p>Accounts Leader</p>
                <p>{{ accountsLeaderPhone }}</p>
                <p>{{ accountsLeaderEmail }}</p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
